- commitment.due_soon: A commitment is about to come due (typically within the next 30 min). Text at `payload.what` ({{trigger.payload.what}}); id at `payload.id`; due ms at `payload.when_due`.
    payload example: {"id":"c_abc","what":"Follow up with vendor","when_due":1710000000000}
- commitment.overdue: A commitment passed its due time without being completed. Text at `payload.what` ({{trigger.payload.what}}); id at `payload.id`; due ms at `payload.when_due`.
